{"Embedding update does not persist changes - the embedding resource update path only re-renders the current snapshot and does not read params or persist changes, so the admin save action can appear to succeed while host/category edits are discarded": 0.6396116614341736, "Hosts now require forced categories - the new schema requires every embeddable host to have a category and the controller rewrites blank category_id values to uncategorized, so nil/no-category state cannot be represented and migration/backfill failures can leave existing hosts without a valid category": 0.7097489237785339, "Normalization and host matching are inconsistent - the model normalizes host in before_validation by stripping schemes and paths, but record_for_host compares against URI(host).host without applying the same normalization, causing false negatives for allowed embeddable hosts": 0.6450079083442688, "URI::InvalidURIError rescue removed from main caller path, so malformed referers now depend entirely on URI(host) behavior": 0.20299114286899567, "Imported embeds now always fall back to uncategorized when host lookup fails - TopicEmbed.import derives post category exclusively from EmbeddableHost.record_for_host(url) and when no record matches, the created topic uses default PostCreator behavior rather than the prior embed category setting": 0.6026470065116882, "Edited host category is not cleared when the chooser is left blank - after successful save the component unconditionally calls Discourse.Category.findById with potentially null categoryId, creating a mismatch between the persisted host record and the UI": 0.500922441482544}